'''Urs & Fenrir''' (フェンリルとウルス ''Fenriru to Urusu'', '''Fenrir and Urs''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy introduced in [[Lifesaving Shovel]], the final stage in [[The Gelatin Mines]]. They are the enemy version of [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs & Fenrir]]. They were added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Urs & Fenrir
|image = E 496.png
|appearance =
|first appearance='''UL''': [[Lifesaving Shovel|Sub-chapter 21 - Lifesaving Shovel]]
|latest appearance='''UL''': [[Atonement for Sin|Sub-chapter 48 - Atonement for Sin]]
|money drop = 1,400¢ - 5,530¢
}}

==Enemy==
While they are a variant of [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]], they behave a bit differently: they have only 50,000 more health and 1/3 as much the speed, but can deliver high DPS at up to 500 range (as opposed to 415), made more dangerous with their [[Omni Strike]] shortening their standing range to 300, meaning they can push significantly. If that wasn't enough, they have only half the number of knockbacks, along with a 100% chance to heavily [[Weaken|weaken]] and [[Curse|curse]] cats for 4 seconds.

